    {
      "anchor": "[check-out-test:REQ-002]",
      "body": "The conversion control shall be available only when the most recently evaluated result is a finite signed whole number; it shall be unavailable before evaluation and for fractional, invalid, error, or non-finite results. *(S1, S2, S3)*",
