    {
      "anchor": "[check-out-test:REQ-003]",
      "body": "Activating the available control while a decimal result is displayed shall replace only the displayed result with its uppercase hexadecimal representation using a `0x` prefix and, for negative values, a leading sign before the prefix. *(S1)*",
